Agentex software is changing the rack mix. Semiconductor Engineering reports, because the agent has to branch

00:00:26.133 --> 00:00:32.133
on what a model returns. That branching is CPU work. The GPU still runs the model.

00:00:32.793 --> 00:00:39.473
Industry estimates in the piece move the CPU to GPU ratio from about 1-4 toward as low as 1-1.

00:00:40.333 --> 00:00:43.813
Arm's sadadol, Batacharji, says CPU demand has risen.

00:00:44.533 --> 00:00:47.453
Synopsis's Ron Loman says the ratio has changed.

00:00:48.033 --> 00:00:53.433
Reasoning models, mixture of experts designs and reservoir computing still sit on GPUs

00:00:53.433 --> 00:00:57.013
and mixture of experts means a query loads fewer parameters.

00:00:58.229 --> 00:01:01.709
UCIe is the common die-to-die interface in that account,

00:01:02.069 --> 00:01:06.029
a way to put compute, IO, and memory interfaces in one package

00:01:06.029 --> 00:01:08.049
without a single proprietary connection.

00:01:08.689 --> 00:01:11.769
Out at system scale, the same post names, PCIe,

00:01:12.349 --> 00:01:15.449
CXL, UCIe, UA link, and Ethernet,

00:01:15.749 --> 00:01:19.269
with 224 gigabits served as underneath the fast links.

00:01:19.269 --> 00:01:19.369
6.

